<fw type="sig" place="bottom">I 4</fw><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Got-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="136" facs="#f0176"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Gotlieb.</hi> I, das i&#x017F;t ja was Pra&#x0364;chtiges,<lb/>
