<fw type="sig" place="bottom">L 3</fw><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Jo-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="166" facs="#f0206"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Johannes.</hi> O ja! Man &#x017F;agt &#x2014; ich<lb/>
