<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Ni-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="268" facs="#f0308"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Nikolas.</hi> Was &#x017F;ind denn das fu&#x0364;r Thiere,<lb/>
